nt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"可靠性工程师(J10116)","OrgId":715990,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 依产品需求制定可靠性测试项目和适用标准；\n2. 输出产品的可靠性测试计划；\n3. 识别产品可靠性设计点；\n4. 开展可靠性失效分析；\n5. 承担模组类项目可靠性测试活动管理","Require":"1. 熟悉存储芯片、存储模组的技术原理；\n2. 了解晶圆制造和芯片工艺流程；\n3. 熟悉可靠性工程的基础知识，掌握可靠性计算或管理工具；\n4. 具备以下条件者优先：\na. 有主控芯片、存储芯片从业经验者；\nb. 熟悉AEC系列、JESD系列、GJB系列和QJ系列国家和行业标准者；\nc. 了解可靠性计算、可靠性预计和分配、可靠性模型；\nd. 有主流电子产品的可靠性从业经验者。\n5. 具有良好的工作习惯和职场文化。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-04-25T16:00:36","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"332d46d7-4543-452b-aada-3aebc0bee51b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351152113,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"UFS测试高级工程师(J10103)","OrgId":475595,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、岗位职责\n负责 eMMC/UFS 在 Android 平台的测试用例设计与开发工作；\n主导 eMMC/UFS 自动化测试脚本及框架的开发、维护与优化；\n分析测试结果，精准定位并跟踪缺陷，推动问题闭环；\n与开发、产品团队紧密协作，参与需求评审及项目风险评估；\n优化测试流程，提升测试效率与覆盖度，保障产品质量。","Require":"二、任职要求\n（一）基本要求\n学历：计算机科学、软件工程、通信工程或相关专业本科及以上学历；\n经验：1-3 年及以上 Android 平台测试或开发相关工作经验。\n（二）核心技术能力\n精通 Android 系统架构（如 Activity 生命周期、四大组件、Binder 机制等），了解 Android 应用开发流程（Java/Kotlin），熟练使用 ADB、Logcat、Systrace、Perfetto 等 Android 调试工具；\n掌握软件测试基础理论（黑盒 / 白盒测试、功能 / 性能 / 稳定性 / 兼容性测试等），熟悉完整测试流程（需求分析→用例设计→执行→缺陷跟踪→回归测试）；\n精通 Python/Shell 至少一种编程语言，熟悉 Monkey、MonkeyRunner、PerfDog 等性能 / 稳定性测试工具，能独立搭建自动化测试框架并编写可维护、可扩展的测试脚本；\n熟悉 Git、Jenkins、GitLab CI 等版本控制与持续集成工具，了解 TestRail、Jira、禅道等测试管理平台，具备 Android 模拟器与真机调试经验及多设备兼容性测试能力。\n（三）软技能\n具备良好的沟通能力与团队协作精神；\n拥有较强的问题分析与定位能力；\n对质量高度敏感，追求极致用户体验；\n主动推动质量改进，具备 Owner 意识。\n（四）加分项\n熟悉 eMMC/UFS 协议及产品测试经验者优先；\n持有 PMP 证书及具备项目管理经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2023-12-21T10:22:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"70720507-a769-46a5-9c93-9d5de3186612","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":350634293,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"